# This file holds the relations that were obtained by special-q sieving
# for the example
#  ("example12c", dict(p=17, E=7, El=4, S=110000, q0=50000, q1=150000)
# Computing these relations took many hours of Sagemath computation (but
# should be instant with better sofrware that is yet to ne written).
# These relations are provided here as a way to accelerate the
# demonstration that our new automorphism-compatible Schirokauer maps
# work as claimed. To use these relations, use the "external_source"
# parameter in the example description, as done in the play_tnfs.sage
# file.
